		<!-- Content -->
		<div class="container">
			<h1 class="mt-4">How to Add a Film to Your Wishlist</h1>
			<h2 class="mt-4">Overview</h2>
			<p>
				Film Tracker allows you to create a wishlist of films or series you want to watch in the future.
				This feature helps you keep track of movies you are interested in
				and makes it easier to decide what to watch next.
			</p>

			<h2 class="mt-4">How to use this feature</h2>
			<h3 class="mt-4">1. Access to your Wishlist</h3>
			<p>
				To access your wishlist, click on the "my watchlist" button in the application.
				This will take you to a page where you can view all the films and series you have added to your wishlist.
			</p>

			<h3 class="mt-4">2. Add an Item to Your Wishlist</h3>

			<p>
				To add a film to your wishlist, find the movie you want to save
				and select the option to add it to your wishlist.
				The film will be saved so you can easily find it later.
			</p>

			<img
				src="/images/add-to-wishlist.png"
				alt="Interface showing how to add a film to the wishlist"
				class="img-fluid rounded border mb-3"
			>

			<h3 class="mt-4">3. View Your Wishlist</h3>

			<p>
				Once a film has been added, it will appear in your wishlist.
				You can browse the films you have saved and choose which one
				you want to watch next.
				You can repeat the process to add more films to your wishlist.
			</p>

			<img
				src="/images/wishlist.png"
				alt="Film Tracker wishlist displaying saved films"
				class="img-fluid rounded border mb-3"
			>

			<h3 class="mt-4">Tips</h3>

			<ul>
				<li>Save films that you are interested in watching later.</li>
				<li>Browse your wishlist whenever you need inspiration for your next movie.</li>
				<li>Keep your wishlist updated as your interests change.</li>
			</ul>

			<p class="mt-4 mb-4">
				<a href="/documentation">Back to Documentation</a>
			</p>
